s tags in the Project Manager loads and saves\r\n`project.godot` through a throwaway `ProjectSettings` instance, even\r\nthough only `application/config/tags` is touched.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n`_apply_project_tags()` now loads and saves `project.godot` with\r\n`ConfigFile` instead of constructing and destroying a full\r\n`ProjectSettings` object. The load-failure message now includes the\r\nactual `Error` code rather than assuming the file is missing/corrupted.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n\r\n- Opened the Project Manager, added tag to a project from godot 4.6 and it didn't change project version.\r\n- Renamed `project.godot` away and confirmed the error dialog reports the error code and the tags dialog is re-shown.\r\n\r\n### AI disclosure\r\n\r\nThe change was authored by me. AI assistance was limited to code\r\ncompletion and review of the C++ edit. I understand and take\r\nresponsibility for the submitted code.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/